      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعدّل</span></b>  <i>It became,</i> or <i>was rendered, straight,</i>
or <i>even;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقَوَّمَ</span>. (Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قوم</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَدَّلَتْ قِيمَةُ المَتَاعِ بِكَذَا</span> <i>The value of the commodity was equal to such a thing;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَامَ المَتَاعُ بِكَذَا</span>.
(Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قوم</span>.)

